<!--
  Demo project in the Rockwell Studio 5000 L5X export format: a small pump
  station with a cooling fan, a pressure relief interlock and a pump with a
  seal-in circuit. Written for OT-Guard's demo and tests; not taken from a
  real plant.
-->
<RSLogix5000Content SchemaRevision="1.0" SoftwareRevision="33.01" TargetName="WaterPlant" TargetType="Controller" ContainsContext="false" Owner="Plant Engineering" ExportDate="Wed Sep 30 10:15:02 2026" ExportOptions="NoRawData L5KData DecoratedData ForceProtectedEncoding AllProjDocTrans">
